 CheckIfItemIsOnTheList←{
⍝ Checks if a product exists in the inventory and displays its price information.
⍝ As argument write → 'name'
     (ItemName⍳⊂⍵)>(≢ItemName):⎕←'Item not found'
     ⎕←'Item Found: '
     ⎕←'Item Name:',ItemName[(ItemName⍳⊂⍵)],' with the price of: ',⍕Price[(ItemName⍳⊂⍵)]
 }
